('NEET','Chemistry','Biomolecules','medium','Enzyme that hydrolyses peptide bond is called:','["Protease","Lipase","Amylase","Nuclease"]',0,'Proteases (peptidases) are enzymes that hydrolyse peptide bonds in proteins.','NCERT Class 12',2023),
('NEET','Chemistry','Organic Chemistry','medium','Baeyer`s reagent is:','["Alkaline KMnO₄","Acidic KMnO₄","Bromine water","H₂SO₄"]',0,'Baeyer`s reagent is cold, dilute, alkaline KMnO₄ — used to test for unsaturation (decolorized by alkenes).','NCERT Class 11',2022),
