('NEET','Chemistry','Organic Chemistry','medium','Markovnikov`s rule predicts addition of HBr to propene gives:','["2-bromopropane","1-bromopropane","Equal amounts of both","No reaction"]',0,'Markovnikov: H adds to less substituted carbon (more H), Br to more substituted C → 2-bromopropane.','NCERT Class 11',2022),
('NEET','Chemistry','Coordination Chemistry','hard','Magnetic moment (μ) of [Fe(CN)₆]³⁻ (low spin, t₂g⁵eg⁰):','["√3 B.M.","√35 B.M.","√15 B.M.","√8 B.M."]',0,'[Fe(CN)₆]³⁻: Fe³⁺(d⁵), strong field CN⁻ → low spin, t₂g⁵, 1 unpaired electron → μ=√(1×3)=√3 B.M.','NCERT Class 12',2024),
('NEET','Chemistry','p-Block Elements','hard','Hybridization of I in IF₇:','["sp³d³","sp³d","sp³d²","sp³"]',0,'IF₇: 7 bond pairs + 0 lone pairs → pentagonal bipyramidal → sp³d³ hybridization.','NCERT Class 12',2023),
('NEET','Chemistry','Organic Chemistry','hard','Gabriel phthalimide synthesis is used to prepare:','["Primary amines","Secondary amines","Tertiary amines","Quaternary ammonium salts"]',0,'Gabriel phthalimide synthesis specifically gives primary amines free of secondary/tertiary amine contamination.','NCERT Class 12',2022),
('NEET','Chemistry','Thermodynamics','hard','For a reaction, ΔG° = −RT ln K. If K >> 1, then ΔG° is:','["Large and negative","Large and positive","Zero","Depends on temperature"]',0,'K>>1 means reaction strongly favours products → ΔG° << 0 (large negative).','NCERT Class 11',2024),
('NEET','Chemistry','Solid State','hard','Schottky defect leads to:','["Decrease in density","Increase in density","No change in density","Electrical conductivity"]',0,'Schottky defect: equal number of cation and anion vacancies → lattice mass decreases → density decreases.','NCERT Class 12',2023);
